+# A vhost-user frontend in a process of its own (virtio-nvgpu's). It speaks the vhost-user
+# protocol to its backend over the socket it was given, serves the backend's requests to map
+# descriptors into the device's shared memory by passing them to the main process over its memory
+# tube, and answers the transport over the device tubes. It opens no file, makes no KVM call and
+# maps nothing into guest memory: the main process checks each mapping again and makes it.
